{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0268"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g4.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",112],["-","1959."],["+","1959"],["=",1],["+","in a bedtime programme of his own, Unser Sandmännchen (The Little Sandman). "],["=",822],["+","Of all of them, the East German trio is the one quiz players are asked about most often, and the duck's name, Schnatterinchen, comes from the German word for chattering. "],["=",193]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",108],["-","auftrat."],["+","auftrat,"],["=",1],["+","in einer eigenen Gute-Nacht-Sendung: Unser Sandmännchen. "],["=",776],["+","Von allen ist das ostdeutsche Trio dasjenige, nach dem in Quizrunden am häufigsten gefragt wird, und der Name der Ente, Schnatterinchen, kommt vom Schnattern. "],["=",193]]}]},
{"seq":3,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0268"},"reason":"a0268 body: Behrendt \"a puppet maker who built the figure in a matter of days\" → \"a stage and costume designer who had just two weeks\"; added SFB rival date 1 Dec 1959; \"The West's version disappeared with reunification\" → \"was dropped in 1989\"; \"public broadcasters of the eastern states\" → \"rbb, MDR and KiKA\" — https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unser_Sandm%C3%A4nnchen","by":"enrich batch 063","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a0004-a0268.md","sources":[{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unser_Sandm%C3%A4nnchen"}]},
{"seq":4,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0268"},"reason":"a0268 body: Pittiplatsch withdrawn after two episodes (Dec 1961) before returning 17 June 1962; Moppi \"shaggy little dog who kept him out of trouble\" → \"fat, pug-like dog (from the 1970s) who usually talks Pitti into mischief\"; Schnatterinchen \"ended every sentence with nak nak\" → \"trademark nak-nak\", first appeared 1959; Heinz Schröder \"for decades\" → \"until 1991\" — https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pittiplatsch_und_Schnatterinchen","by":"enrich batch 063","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a0004-a0268.md","sources":[{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pittiplatsch_und_Schnatterinchen"}]},
